    "body": "Deduplicates code in silent payments as suggested by @theStack at https://github.com/bitcoin-core/secp256k1/pull/1943#pullrequestreview-5578778611.\n\n- Turns `output_tweak` into a reusable constant.\n- Adds function `labels_cache_set_neg_output_tweak` for setting the cache for negated `OUTPUT_TWEAK`.\n- Adds function `prevouts_summary_create_bob` for creating `secp256k1_silentpayments_prevouts_summary` with bob's first address key.",
